    "sections": {
        "description": "Ai Blog Plus is a fast, SEO-friendly WordPress theme designed for AI bloggers, tech magazines, news portals, and digital publishers. It combines a modern responsive grid layout, clean typography, and Gutenberg block support to create a polished reading experience on desktops, tablets, and smartphones. The theme includes flexible customization options, multiple sidebar and column layouts, custom logo and menu support, featured images, translation readiness, and lightweight, performance-optimized code. Whether you run an AI news site, technology blog, startup magazine, or content-driven publication, Ai Blog Plus helps you publish engaging, search-engine-optimized content that loads quickly, ranks higher, and keeps readers on your site longer."
    },
